OL,3,GNEWSAWater reservoir at lowest ever    
OL,4,Alevel                                  
OL,6,FThe water level at an East of England  
OL,7,Freservoir is at a record low, a water  
OL,8,Fcompany has confirmed.                 
OL,10,FEssex and Suffolk Water director Kieran
OL,11,FIngram said Hanningfield Reservoir near
OL,12,FChelmsford was 35% of full capacity,   
OL,13,Fcompared with a norm of "65-70%"       
OL,14,Fexpected at this time of year.         
OL,16,FOn 3 August, the company imposed its   
OL,17,Ffirst hosepipe ban since 1997, which   
OL,18,Fhas still not lifted due to an         
OL,19,F"exceptionally dry" summer and         
OL,20,Fdisappointing rainfall levels in the   
OL,21,Fautumn.                                
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
