OL,4,Alevel                                  
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Look East, he          
OL,7,Fclarified: "[We are] not wanting to    
OL,8,Fscare any customers because your water 
OL,9,Fsupply is not in danger but certainly  
OL,10,Fwe're not out of the woods yet."       
